  "editorial": {
    "name": "GermaVinsmoke/react-timezone-range-picker",
    "descriptionZh": "一个有时区意识的日期时间区间选择器，UI 用 Mantine 组件搭，时区换算走 Temporal API 并配了旧浏览器 polyfill。",
    "takeawayZh": "拿一个 Basic/Advanced 两档切换的时区区间选择器",
    "noteZh": "README 副标是 Flexible, Mantine-powered UI components for building timezone-aware date and time range pickers。Features 里写 Basic 模式给一个只有日期的区间字段和可滚动的 day quick ranges，Advanced 模式拆出独立的起止日期与时间字段、相对时间、around-time 选择和时区切换。Picker modes 一节说明 Basic 模式下的选择立即生效、不设 Apply 按钮，返回时间统一归到 00:00:00，要回 Basic 就按左下角的 Basic 按钮。仓库是 pnpm workspace，分 apps/playground 与 packages/ui 两块，MIT license。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
    "pricingNote": null
  },
